// CCI Reversal
//
// Donald Lambert's commodity channel index measures how far price sits from its own mean
// in units of mean deviation. Lambert traded the ±100 band as a trend signal; the reversal
// reading below is the other common published use.
//
// Note the asymmetry: entry needs -100 crossed from below (exhaustion ending), exit takes
// the return to zero rather than waiting for +100, because the far band arrives rarely.
strategy("CCI Reversal", overlay = false)

c = cci(20)

plot(c,    title = "CCI", color = color.accent)
plot(100,  title = "+100", color = color.mute, style = style.step)
plot(-100, title = "-100", color = color.mute, style = style.step)

if crossover(c, -100)
    strategy.entry("cci", strategy.long)

if crossover(c, 0)
    strategy.close("cci")
